{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10078","headline":"同李吏部伏日口号呈元庶子路中丞 · 包佶","name":"同李吏部伏日口号呈元庶子路中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"火炎逢六月，金伏过三庚。\n几度衣裳汗，谁家枕簟清。\n颁冰无下位，裁扇有高名。\n吏部还开瓮，殷勤二客情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包佶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10078.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10078","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}